        "TileImage": "$($repository 0c88a00d-0c90-4709-a119-55a8d8c9db50).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47.\r\rThese targets are true monsters. They are selfish, arrogant, gluttonous beasts who call JoJo parts &apos;seasons&apos;, they deserve their fates. They are also pdfs so theres that aswell.\r\rYou job here is to give them a taste of their own medicine,  you must get the targets to bend over, touch their toes, and show them where the monster goes...",
